=== SURVEY ===
Baseline behaviour preserved for users with settings.ai_mode='off':
  - Manual SQL playground page mounted at /power/sql.
  - Render contract: page title "SQL Playground", an introductory
    paragraph, a manual SQL <Textarea aria-label="SQL query editor">
    inside a GlassPanel, a "Run" Button, a "Clear" Button, an
    inline status pill for the run-message hint, and a curated
    schema catalog viewer GlassPanel listing the 5 in-scope tables
    (drives, charging_sessions, vehicles, alerts, signal_log_view)
    with column metadata.
  - Persistence: SQL textarea contents survive across navigation
    via localStorage key 'ai.sqlPlayground.draft' (the canonical
    Client storage key the slice prompt names).
  - Run semantics: Phase-50 / 0057's "Allowed files" list does
    NOT permit adding a backend SQL execution endpoint, so Run
    surfaces a deterministic instruction to copy the query into
    a preferred external DB tool. A future slice can swap that
    branch for a typed read-only execution endpoint without
    churning this page's render tree.
  - The page-root marker data-testid="power-sql-playground-root"
    is always present (off + on mode alike). The AI section's
    data-testid="ai-feature-nl-sql-playground-root" is absent in
    off mode (rendered conditionally via withAiFeature).

